# 这个目录是给 Tripo 出的 GLB 用的

跑完 `python ../tripo-gen.py` 后，把 `out/models/*.glb` 拷到这个目录。

例如：
```
xiaoman.glb    → assets/models/xiaoman.glb
aize.glb       → assets/models/aize.glb
grandma.glb    → assets/models/grandma.glb
bread_basket.glb → assets/models/bread_basket.glb
book_stack.glb   → assets/models/book_stack.glb
tomato_basket.glb → assets/models/tomato_basket.glb
```